          "properties": {
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Evaluates the consistency of recorded trip distances against route-specific peer benchmarks.\n\nEach benchmark is calculated as the median distance recorded by other drivers traveling between the same pair of locations.\n\nA valid benchmark requires at least 20 comparable trips from two other drivers.\n\nGeneric destinations such as \"Shop\" and \"Office\" are excluded from benchmark assessment because their exact locations are unknown.\n\nMinimum and maximum deviations represent the range observed across assessed trips within the selected filters.\n\nLow mileage variation does not confirm the accuracy of recorded distances or rule out irregularities.'"
